{"id": "8th-u4-q439", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u7-aram", "lesson_id": "8th-u4-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "literary-terms-kedaram", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இலக்கியச் சிறப்புப் பெயர்களையும் தொடர்புடைய ஆளுமைகள்/நூல்களையும் பொருத்துக:\nஅ) தம்பிரான் தோழர் - 1. பெரியபுராணம்\nஆ) முதல்நூல் - 2. நம்பியாண்டார் நம்பி\nஇ) வழிநூல் - 3. சுந்தரர்\nஈ) தேவாரம் தொகுத்தவர் - 4. திருத்தொண்டத்தொகை"}], "options": ["அ-1, ஆ-2, இ-3, ஈ-4", "அ-2, ஆ-4, இ-1, ஈ-3", "அ-3, ஆ-4, இ-1, ஈ-2", "அ-4, ஆ-3, இ-2, ஈ-1"], "explanation": "தம்பிரான் தோழர் = சுந்தரர் (3); முதல்நூல் = திருத்தொண்டத்தொகை (4); வழிநூல் = பெரியபுராணம் (1); தேவாரம் தொகுத்தவர் = நம்பியாண்டார் நம்பி (2). சரியான வரிசை: அ-3, ஆ-4, இ-1, ஈ-2."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the literary designations with the corresponding personalities/texts:\na) Thambiran Thozhar - 1. Periyapuranam\nb) Muthal Nool (Source text) - 2. Nambiyandar Nambi\nc) Vazhi Nool (Secondary text) - 3. Sundarar\nd) Compiler of Thevaram - 4. Thirutthondathogai"}], "options": ["a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "a-2, b-4, c-1, d-3", "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "a-4, b-3, c-2, d-1"], "explanation": "Thambiran Thozhar = Sundarar (3); Primary text = Thirutthondathogai (4); Derivative text = Periyapuranam (1); Compiler of Thevaram = Nambiyandar Nambi (2). Sequence: a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [{"left_ta": "தம்பிரான் தோழர்", "left_en": "Thambiran Thozhar", "right_ta": "சுந்தரர்", "right_en": "Sundarar"}, {"left_ta": "முதல்நூல்", "left_en": "Primary text", "right_ta": "திருத்தொண்டத்தொகை", "right_en": "Thirutthondathogai"}, {"left_ta": "வழிநூல்", "left_en": "Derivative text", "right_ta": "பெரியபுராணம்", "right_en": "Periyapuranam"}, {"left_ta": "தேவாரம் தொகுத்தவர்", "left_en": "Compiler of Thevaram", "right_ta": "நம்பியாண்டார் நம்பி", "right_en": "Nambiyandar Nambi"}], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 69, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["literature", "matching", "thevaram"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u4-q440", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u4-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "metrics-alavadi", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'பண்ணின் தமிழ் இசைபாடலின் பழவேய்முழவு அதிரக்' - இப்பாடல் அடியில் பயின்று வந்துள்ள அடிவகை யாது?"}], "options": ["குறளடி (இரண்டு சீர்கள்)", "சிந்தடி (மூன்று சீர்கள்)", "நெடிலடி (ஐந்து சீர்கள்)", "அளவடி (நான்கு சீர்கள்)"], "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 69 அடிவகை விளக்கத்தின்படி: இப்பாடலின் ஒவ்வோர் அடியிலும் நான்கு சீர்கள் (1. பண்ணின், 2. தமிழ், 3. இசைபாடலின், 4. பழவேய்முழவு அதிரக்) இடம் பெற்றுள்ளன. இவ்வாறு நான்கு சீர்களைக் கொண்ட அடி 'அளவடி' எனப்படும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is the metric classification of the line: 'பண்ணின் தமிழ் இசைபாடலின் பழவேய்முழவு அதிரக்'?"}], "options": ["Kuraladi (Two seers)", "Cinthadi (Three seers)", "Nediladi (Five seers)", "Alavadi (Four seers)"], "explanation": "As explained on page 69, each line of this hymn contains 4 metrical feet (seers). A poetic line having four seers is termed 'Alavadi'. Option D is correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 69, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["grammar", "metrics", "alavadi"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
