{"id": "8th-u4-q448", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u4-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "terracotta-english-direct", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "களிமண்ணால் செய்யப்பட்டுச் சூளையில் சுட்டு எடுக்கப்படும் சுடுமண் சிற்பங்களை ஆங்கிலத்தில் எவ்வாறு அழைப்பர்?"}], "options": ["Sculpture", "Pottery", "Handicraft", "Terracotta"], "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 71-இன் படி, சுடுமண் சிற்பக்கலையை ஆங்கிலத்தில் 'டெரகோட்டா' (Terracotta) என்று அழைப்பர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is the English term used for baked clay pottery sculptures (சுடுமண் சிற்பங்கள்)?"}], "options": ["Sculpture", "Pottery", "Handicraft", "Terracotta"], "explanation": "According to textbook page 71, baked clay sculptures are known in English as 'Terracotta'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 71, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "pa