{"id": "8th-u4-q532", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "8th-u4-l4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "terinilai-vinaiyeccam-direct", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'எழுதி வந்தான்' என்னும் தொடரில் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள எச்ச வகை எது?"}], "options": ["குறிப்புப் பெயரெச்சம்", "குறிப்பு வினையெச்சம்", "தெரிநிலைப் பெயரெச்சம்", "தெரிநிலை வினையெச்சம்"], "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 82-இன் படி: 'எழுதி வந்தான்' என்பதில் 'எழுதி' என்பது செயலையும் காலத்தையும் வெளிப்படையாகக் காட்டி வினைமுற்றைக் கொண்டு முடிவதால் இது 'தெரிநிலை வினையெச்சம்' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which type of participle is present in the phrase 'எழுதி வந்தான்'?"}], "options": ["Kurippu Peyareccam", "Kurippu Vinaiyeccam", "Terinilai Peyareccam", "Terinilai Vinaiyeccam"], "explanation": "Textbook page 82: 'எழுதி' overtly shows the action of writing and past tense before ending in a verb, classifying it as Terinilai Vinaiyeccam."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 82, "chapter": null, "section": n